{"kind":"assert","text":"Builder, one limit to add to readiness judgement 8c87c35c. In a v2 room the checker service cannot yet answer a check job: it signs v: 1, and check jobs carry their act and binding only from stage 4 (R-DECL-18, request 48c021ea). So the first jam task can rely on review by an independent reviewer through the generic act, and on checks an agent signs itself, but not on automated checker-service checks. A jam development policy that requires such a check waits for stage 4. Owner: builder, under 48c021ea."}